{"title":"MIE 2016/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Objective:\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objective:</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Step_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Step 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Step_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Step 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The following system has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> integer solutions. We can say that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/b/b4b03ed0218784e2a44c146af69dcb43a0e55f54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\begin{cases}\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x}&gt;3\\\\\\\\x\\leq12\\end{cases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -33px\" width=\"114\" height=\"75\" />\n</p><p><br />\n(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/f/f3fcab1b2fcb409eda856956d0d11b1a5330ded3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\leq k\\leq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/7/547e5dd37a024136d990b0996d8829269c236c8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\leq k\\leq 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(c) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/3/1437ae61a7e5566e0b4901710d132254e48e5cd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\leq k\\leq6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(d) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/4/504ac467036dda6dea24d2d3e43f47e018240e6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\leq k\\leq8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>(e) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82681964dc24de82892ae5e51400219fb0c652b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\geq8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objective:\">Objective:</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Objective:\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We can solve this problem in two steps: First, we solve for the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45dbc40a0b64aee62fc42c680ccf70eccb3e60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x}&gt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"136\" height=\"39\" />, then combine it with the range of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/9/589e31492817c7751c836d3257a25835df91e413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\leq12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> to get a compound inequality which we can use to find all possible integer solutions.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Step_1\">Step 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Step 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>We first find the range of the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/4/5b45dbc40a0b64aee62fc42c680ccf70eccb3e60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x}&gt;3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"136\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>We now simplify the inequality: \n</p><p>Case 0: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>This has no solutions since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> will make the function undefined.\n</p><p>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/658a831c55ebc7bd867dd7c69a91d5476bc3fc87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x\\leq12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d92e0685582338f36c13cd9709247ff8ed9fd37c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x}&gt;3\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d2e5251ffb1fdbb69fbd0fd372427485d74e11.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 - 2x - 14&gt;3x\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/d/1ed72d5256d83391738c6a9f937ca2cd678feb47.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 - 5x - 14 &gt; 0\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"15\" />\nFactoring, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/9/1597dac3d5bfc8012479bab8a93f079bd5a4ae5b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-7)(x+2)&gt;0\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />\nNow, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />.\nBut in this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/658a831c55ebc7bd867dd7c69a91d5476bc3fc87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x\\leq12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, and this further restricts our solutions.\nSo, for the case where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/658a831c55ebc7bd867dd7c69a91d5476bc3fc87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x\\leq12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />, our solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74f35913bf423f559bae7238ff6e24dc48cf3caa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7&lt;x\\leq12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6ee81a7a535d87853e848c77654cc36104a75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d92e0685582338f36c13cd9709247ff8ed9fd37c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x}&gt;3\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/3/1e3566d0472f90a6f5e965e0d424463584f47e84.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2-2x-14&lt;3x\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/486702f14059361b599583e9f3855a7099de0a65.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2-5x - 14&lt;0\\]\" width=\"132\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daa7db1470c28d303e5d4c86a71f803338cb5f62.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-7)(x+2)&lt;0\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />\nWe have in this case that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/7/8478f3aa224751a4293f81f782728bad6279912b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2&lt;x&lt;7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"15\" />, but the case statement further restricts our solutions.\n</p><p>For this case, the solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729c620e26bc9a06a50ac1f63ffbcb352f900be0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2&lt;x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Step_2\">Step 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Step 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Now, we know the solutions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />: in the first case, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74f35913bf423f559bae7238ff6e24dc48cf3caa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7&lt;x\\leq12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />, the integer solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/b/cab6cc2a7a6ba6a2bb6ec166402fb73fb69faa88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = {8, 9, 10, 11, 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"139\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>In the second case, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729c620e26bc9a06a50ac1f63ffbcb352f900be0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2&lt;x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />, the only integer solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a47c3b84bd30b223c5d2c2e463d48cf5fd67974.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = {-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>The union of these two cases gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/7/9376f77d29603efe71d41b68a6bcb131d1058870.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = {-1, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"170\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a295acb9662ee1bae4bb3aa92a1f42b2cfd83f10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> solutions and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/4/504ac467036dda6dea24d2d3e43f47e018240e6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6\\leq k\\leq8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/4/a74fe366d9c39eb72db2e760bd9fc53b245a84d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" />\n~Windigo\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/a/23a7352c4678b738531147da33fa6dd23afbd53f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\le 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> is the simpler condition, we can apply it to the solution of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f85b33cfdba1e5969436e1000f61a08eac7048.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x} &lt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"136\" height=\"39\" />. We can find the solution of the first inequality given in the problem by simplifying and using the Snake Method. To use the Snake Method, we need to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> on one of the sides, and factor the other. To do this, we can subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/6/3c6cfaccdcc203ebcb6ea09268cc0e4c8fffbff8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3x}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"21\" height=\"37\" /> from both sides, going from\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/8/e581cbcceb8ff2f03081e18975987815cbaf63dd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x^2-2x-14}{x} &lt; 3\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"39\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/0/d10f4caf0417746fddacaa933c11465fb68fd167.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x^2-2x-14-3x}{x} &lt; 0\\]\" width=\"176\" height=\"39\" /> and combining like terms to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/2/c428e7dc9c72acaae06c2be3b1f74bb5b7a74adc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x^2-5x-14}{x} &lt; 0\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"39\" /> factoring to get the usable form of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e92a2c8a831b675cb00192070dc42c4acec95d68.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(x+2)(x-7)}{x} &lt; 0\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"38\" /> Using the snake method, we can build a table.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>Snake Table\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825f880cb222ec2cc60fd40996c91d26ce9bf329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\space$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d07f0146def05358469b8fc546549d08c7984720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729c620e26bc9a06a50ac1f63ffbcb352f900be0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2&lt;x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/d/b4dd4223914ea6ad76b4cc08c62db2081d77994d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;x&lt;7$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/9/5d9bd26dc8984741137754eedae87af0f5e92786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7&lt;x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8ab0ec5027c055e1b34dc345b1d8532b611bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/1/6813263821c393315a09096ddd1570aefe30af36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-7$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>multiplied\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add22d9bda21e86390bc74fa4dde17730a442da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</td>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77cf26be132ef93923e082ee4153b2cb0ef44a50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Using this table, we can find out that this inequality is true when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729c620e26bc9a06a50ac1f63ffbcb352f900be0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2&lt;x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/9/5d9bd26dc8984741137754eedae87af0f5e92786.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7&lt;x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />. Applying the second inequality, we can modify these to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729c620e26bc9a06a50ac1f63ffbcb352f900be0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2&lt;x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/8/fe8d05cbf78f15590c65daf0e82acee2c46db5b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7&lt;x\\le12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" /> so they fit the whole set. Counting the number of integers that satisfy these conditions, we can see that the six numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/7/c9772aa7d1acf0f4def78b80aad68f399753463b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1, 8, 9, 10, 11, 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"135\" height=\"16\" /> fit these conditions. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/4/a74fe366d9c39eb72db2e760bd9fc53b245a84d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/5/d7573b1a9657fdbeac252a27d0762f406de1fd1c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\space\\]\" />\n-Aurora64 ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MIE_2016/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018093829\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 1.289 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 410/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 13718/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15871:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018093829 and revision id 134530. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}